  "label": "Sexual Objectification Stereotype",
  "description": "The text 'when they fuck' explicitly sexualizes the subjects, reducing them to their sexual function and ignoring their humanity. This relies on the real-world stereotype of sexual objectification, which involves treating people as objects for sexual gratification rather than as individuals with agency, dignity, and autonomy. The combination of infantilization and sexual objectification is a particularly degrading form of stereotyping.",
